BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CIS: Siblings
DTSTART:20251115T020000Z
DTEND:20251115T034500Z
DTSTAMP:20251115T020000Z
UID:ZZjURIVO4W
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nCinema Italian Style Siblings is 
 a charming comedy-drama about various diagnoses\, the courage required to 
 see the world with open eyes\, and how it is never too late to get to know
  your own sibling.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cinema-ital
 ian-style-2025/siblings\n\nEstimated start: 18:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CIS: Madly
DTSTART:20251115T043000Z
DTEND:20251115T062500Z
DTSTAMP:20251115T043000Z
UID:25K9R2ZPA9
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nCinema Italian Style And you thou
 ght your internal monologue was hectic! As Piero and Lara embark upon thei
 r first date\, an ensemble of game performers act out their competing thou
 ghts and emotions\, Inside Out/”Herman’s Head”-style\, in the latest
  from Paolo Genovese (Perfect Strangers).\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs
 -and-events/cinema-italian-style-2025/madly\n\nEstimated start: 20:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CIS: Damned If You Do
DTSTART:20251115T213000Z
DTEND:20251115T232500Z
DTSTAMP:20251115T213000Z
UID:j5S1kRMR8q
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nCinema Italian Style A retired pr
 ofessor’s peaceful life – with a good pension\, friends\, and a compan
 ion – is disrupted when his daughter and two unruly children arrive.\n\n
 https://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cinema-italian-style-2025/damned-
 if-you-do-damned-if-you-dont\n\nEstimated start: 13:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CIS: The Best Reward
DTSTART:20251116T001500Z
DTEND:20251116T021000Z
DTSTAMP:20251116T001500Z
UID:jvepG2VqOS
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nCinema Italian Style Mattia is a 
 teenager from small-town Italy. Tormented by guilt over his brother’s de
 ath\, he drops out of school\, starts to work at a local factory\, and con
 verts to Islam. Will he avoid the trap of isolation and violence? Director
  Federico Ferrone scheduled to attend.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-an
 d-events/cinema-italian-style-2025/the-best-reward\n\nEstimated start: 16:
 30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CIS: La Grazia
DTSTART:20251116T030000Z
DTEND:20251116T053000Z
DTSTAMP:20251116T030000Z
UID:j9fq1DaAlt
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 131 mins (2h11m)\n\nCinema Italian Style Oscar winne
 r Paolo Sorrentino (The Great Beauty\, Il Divo) returns to the baroque wor
 ld of Italian presidential politics\, crafting an elegantly restrained por
 trait of a fictional ruler (Toni Servillo) reckoning with age\, power\, an
 d moral obligation as his term comes to a close.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/p
 rograms-and-events/cinema-italian-style-2025/la-grazia\n\nEstimated start:
  19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CIS: I Married You For Joy (1967)
DTSTART:20251116T210000Z
DTEND:20251116T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20251116T210000Z
UID:avcC0uVQ9C
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nCinema Italian Style Pietro is a
  young bourgeois lawyer who married Giuliana\, a wild pretty girl he met a
 t an artists’ party. Despite the premises\, everything between the two s
 eems to be going well\, until his mother’s visit... New 4K restoration 
 from Cinecittà.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cinema-italia
 n-style-2025/i-married-you-for-joy\n\nEstimated start: 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CIS: Heads or Tails?
DTSTART:20251116T231500Z
DTEND:20251117T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20251116T231500Z
UID:qfrfMVEJ6B
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 116 mins (1h56m)\n\nCinema Italian Style John C. Rei
 lly plays a troubadour-style Buffalo Bill Cody in this cheerfully deranged
  genre riff from The Tale of King Crab directors Alessio Rigo de Righi and
  Matteo Zoppis.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/cinema-italian
 -style-2025/heads-or-tails\n\nEstimated start: 15:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
